                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a9edb460-ce03-326e-8fde-0bed9d631cf7",
                        "entry_id": "9e86f9ef-a511-3599-8c44-f19cd5440440",
                        "glosses": [
                            "extremely urgent"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd674c89-3902-4aca-8d1c-3e23791d4e53",
                                "sense_id": "a9edb460-ce03-326e-8fde-0bed9d631cf7",
                                "text": "— У меня́ д-для ва́шего высокопревосходи́тельства сверхсро́чное и с-соверше́нно к-конфиденциа́льное сообще́ние, — бесстра́стно произнё́с ста́тский сове́тник, взгляну́в на адъюта́нта. — Извини́те, п-подполко́вник, но такова́ п-полу́ченная мно́ю инстру́кция.",
                                "translation": "'I have an extremely urgent and absolutely c-confidential message for Your Excellency,' the State Counsellor said impassively, with a glance at the adjutant. 'I beg your pardon, L-Lieutenant Colonel, but those are the instructions I was g-given.'",
                                "english": "'I have an extremely urgent and absolutely c-confidential message for Your Excellency,' the State Counsellor said impassively, with a glance at the adjutant. 'I beg your pardon, L-Lieutenant Colonel, but those are the instructions I was g-given.'"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
